  "details": "# Issue: \n\nWhen selecting a different Instance of a world the menu now does the same animation as if you were clicking on a different world. (flying in from the side)\n\nWhile I think it's good to have something that indicates that you have selected a different instance, I think what it currently does is a bit too much. It's really distracting and just too much movement for something like this.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nEither completely remove the animation (that's how it currently is on live) or replace it with something more subtle. As the current animation is too distracting and moves too much.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/k8nkg8.mp4\n\nAnd here is a video showcasing how it looks on live:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/msewyo.mp4",
